{"kind": "mod", "id": 1516, "name": "SamSWAT Guns - Realism Compatibility Patch", "slug": "samswat-guns-realism-compatibility-patch", "teaser": "This adds SPT Realism compatibility for SamSwat's L85A2 and GIAT FAMAS by OptimusChad.", "owner_name": "Therkelsen", "downloads": 2016, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-13T18:04:46.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-07-02T18:05:54.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-07-02T18:05:54.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.9.0", "latest_version": "1.0.4", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p><strong>Contents</strong></p>\n<p>Compatibility patches for the following weapons:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>FAMAS</li>\n<li>L85A2</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you experience any issues, feel free to open an issue. If fixing it yourself is more your thing, there’s a guide on how to contribute on the GitHub repository.</p>\n<p><strong>Dependencies</strong></p>\n<p>You’ll need the weapon mod that you need compatibility for, so: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2269-samswat-s-l85a2-and-giat-famas/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>SamSwat’s L85A2 and GIAT FAMAS</strong></a> by <strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/55363-optimuschad/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">OptimusChad</a>,</strong> and <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/606-spt-realism-mod/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>SPT Realism</strong></a> for this to do anything.</p>\n<p>This still has compatibility for MAW / GFL by DJLang, but those have been delisted from the hub, for now.</p>\n<p>Installation</p>\n<p>1. Download the latest release.</p>\n<p>2- Drop the provided user folder into your SPT folder.</p>\n<p>If the changes don’t load, you may want to also clear cache / temp files.</p>\n<p>1. In \\user\\cache, delete:</p>\n<p>bundleHashCache.json, jsonCache.json, and modCache.json</p>\n<p>But do NOT delete the folder named bundles.</p>\n<p>2. In the SPT launcher, clear temp files:</p>\n<p>Open launcher &gt; Click settings &gt; Click clean temp files</p>\n<p>I <em>might</em> add support for more SamSWAT ports in the future.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.3", "content_length": null, "downloads": 277, "published_at": "2024-07-02T18:05:54.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1516/samswat-guns-realism-compatibility-patch/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.3", "content_length": null, "downloads": 372, "published_at": "2024-07-03T17:20:34.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1516/samswat-guns-realism-compatibility-patch/1.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 422, "published_at": "2024-08-26T15:02:48.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1516/samswat-guns-realism-compatibility-patch/1.0.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.3", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 345, "published_at": "2024-09-19T04:24:29.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1516/samswat-guns-realism-compatibility-patch/1.0.3", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.